  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/gamerz_riot/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_d07d8934-0938-40a3-9a98-35115ec750cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fgamerz_riot07\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_b489e76c-8d04-4cc4-974f-8ee9c9a5b7c6.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cJ3bs3XxHr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7bf6a59b-bf4a-4867-8bdf-2d31fd360227.png\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Gamerz_Riot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/674973/description_7f1a7c2a-b5f5-4a60-a7f4-280b1e85792b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"196\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">链接</span> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;text-decoration:underline\">⛯</span></span></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&ust=1668095020051000&source=images&cd=vfe&ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">⮞</span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#fbeeb8\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252foneblock-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">OneBlock Reborn</span> [数据包]</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></span></a></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">⮜</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&url=https://toppng.com/instagram-logo-circle-PNG-free-PNG-Images_79801&psig=AOvVaw00odNRdAatiHsbge0BntMM&ust=1668095020051000&source=images&cd=vfe&ved=0CA0QjRxqFwoTCKiR_ay4ofsCFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\">⮞</span><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/skyblock-horizon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">SkyBlock Horizon</span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"> [地图]</span></a></span>&nbsp;</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⮜</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">在最终的 <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">1.21 更新</span>之后，OneBlock Reborn 地图<br>将作为独立的世界生成数据包</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></pre>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"> </span></strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>OneBlock Reborn</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f0f\"><strong>Oneblock Reborn</strong></span> 是一款冒险地图，它是 <strong>IJAMinecraft 的 OneBlock 地图</strong> 的续作。在这张地图中，你将出生在一个漂浮于虚空之上的单一方块上。该方块是无限的，并且你会根据生物群系的不同经历不同的阶段。这张地图充满了冒险与挑战。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>⛯ </strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">在社交媒体展示时请注明创作者信息。</span></strong></span></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下载 OneBlock：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/oneblock-reborn</a><br>&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">&gt;</span></strong> 下载原版（IJAMinecraft）：<a href=\"ijaminecraft.com/map/oneblock/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> https://ijaminecraft.com/oneblock</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">⛯ </span>简介：&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在这张地图中，你将出生在一个单一方块上。本地图包含 15 个阶段，每个阶段都有独特的主题。你还可以进入<span style=\"color:#f00\">下界</span>或 <span style=\"color:#00f\">末地</span>.<br></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地图中的方块和生物会随阶段变化而刷新。本地图新增了方解石与凝灰岩的合成配方（详见图片）。</span></strong></span></span>&nbsp; OneBlock Reborn 此前名为 OneBlock Classic。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#843fa1;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>视频教程</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"width:255px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Rvbzk_GaeJw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:261px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7TOImSxgZts?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:262px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kmjZSxd0h1A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"256\" height=\"146\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>! 安装方法！（单人游戏）</strong></span></p>\n<ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下载地图并使用 WinRAR 或 7-Zip 解压。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">解压后会得到一个文件夹。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">随后<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>复制</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>或<span style=\"color:#036\"><em><strong>移动</strong>&nbsp;</em></span>该文件夹到<span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>Minecraft 存档（saves）</strong></span>文件夹中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">至此，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#36f\"><strong>OneBlock</strong></span> 已安装完成。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">现在你可以在<strong>&nbsp;Minecraft</strong> 中体验了.<br></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>! 安装方法！（多人游戏）</strong></span></p>\n<ul style=\"font-weight:400\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">下载地图并使用 WinRAR 或 7-Zip 解压。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">随后<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>重命名</strong></span>解压后的文件夹为\"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\"。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">之后，将\"<span style=\"color:#f0f\"><strong>world</strong></span>\"文件夹<span style=\"color:#036\"><strong><em><strong><em>上传</em></strong>&nbsp;</em></strong></span>至你的服务器托管面板。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">至此，<span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">OneBlock</span></strong></span> 已在你的<strong><span style=\"color:#008000\">服务器</span></strong>上安装完成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">现在你可以在<strong>Minecraft 服务器</strong>中体验了。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>鸣谢 / 相关链接</strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/IJAMinecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 YouTube 频道。</strong></span></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fijaminecraft.com%252fmap%252foneblock%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>IJAMinecraft 的 OneBlock 项目。</strong></span></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBxC-rDu4a2SKFdDPXfVxmw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></strong></span></span></span></p>",
